# web (Next.js) — {% .ProjectName%}

AI agent instructions for the Next.js web application.

## Stack

- Next.js 14 (App Router), React 18, TypeScript (strict, noUncheckedIndexedAccess)
- Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui components
- Jest + Testing Library

## Rules

- TypeScript strict mode: no `any` without `// @ts-expect-error` + justification.
- Use the generated API client in `src/lib/api.ts`; do not hand-roll fetch calls.
- Components live in `src/components`; app routes in `src/app`.
- All changes require tests (`pnpm test`).

## Commands

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm dev        # development server
pnpm build      # production build
pnpm typecheck  # tsc --noEmit
pnpm lint       # ESLint
pnpm test       # Jest
```
